{"id":6761,"date":"2020-02-15T10:18:23","date_gmt":"2020-02-15T15:18:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=6761"},"modified":"2020-02-15T17:39:07","modified_gmt":"2020-02-15T22:39:07","slug":"mexico-day-one","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/02\/15\/mexico-day-one\/","title":{"rendered":"Mexico Day One"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Our first day in Mexico was without our RV&#8217;s. Our caravan of 27 rigs has been divided into four smaller groups to make the trip(s) more manageable. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Kathy and I are the second rig in Group 2. Today the mission for each group is to drive our cars 20 minutes to the border crossing of Tecate. We carpooled and parked our cars in a public lot ($5 U.S.) and walked across. We stayed in our smaller groups of 8-10 people as we toured the town.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6766\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_075905-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Our walk across the border after getting our FMM cards<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Each group&#8217;s mission was to check in with Mexican authorities and get our FMM cards, exchange our dollars for pesos, enjoy breakfast at an open air cafe, visit Tecate Brewery (free beer), visit a Wonderful bakery, and anything else we wanted as long as we were back to Potrero Bark by 3pm or so.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6767\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6767\" class=\"wp-image-6767\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090241-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Our whole bill less than $10<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6768\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6768\" class=\"wp-image-6768\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_090841-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Kathy&#8217;s pancakes, bacon &amp; eggs<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6769\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6769\" class=\"wp-image-6769\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_094144-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The outdoor seating area<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Our breakfast(s) at the outdoor cafe only cost us about $10 including tip<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6770\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6770\" class=\"wp-image-6770\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_103739-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Resting a bit at the Tecate Town Park<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6771\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6771\" class=\"wp-image-6771\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_112020-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Enjoying free beer at Tecate Brewery<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"360\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C324&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6772\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1213&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6772\" class=\"wp-image-6772\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-300x142.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-1024x485.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-768x364.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-1536x728.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-2048x970.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-685x324.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200213_131253-2000x947.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The border wall at the crossing<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>I needed to buy a cheap cell phone for Mexico as my service provider does not include Mexico coverage.  A couple of folks in our group found a pharmacy to  get some much needed aids (drugs) to help with their ailments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Along the way some of us felt the need to get some ice cream too!  I should&#8217;ve got a picture of that .. sorry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The Mexican people are very friendly and smile and wave. A smile back with a &#8220;Hola&#8221; or &#8220;Buenos Dias&#8221; goes a long way way toward making new friends in a strange country.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>One funny experience we had was our interaction with the border crossing official. After he reviews and processes your passport and FMM card (and collects your $31), he then graciously offers to sell you either honey or hot sauce and he&#8217;s sure to tell you the hot sauce is &#8220;good on your eggs in the morning!&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Back to Potrero Park for an afternoon info meeting, Happy Hour, dump our tanks in preparation for tomorrow mornings trip across the border, and finish off the night with a nice campfire.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>More tomorrow as we drive south and enter the &#8220;Zoologico Parque del Nino Jersey&#8221; (zoo) at Guadalupe which will be our home for the next few days.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our first day in Mexico was without our RV&#8217;s. Our caravan of 27 rigs has been divided into four smaller groups to make the trip(s) more manageable. Kathy and I are the second rig in Group 2. Today the mission for each group is to drive our cars 20 minutes to the border crossing of &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/02\/15\/mexico-day-one\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Mexico Day One<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554707839,586,677,554707836,554707329],"tags":[554707837,554707840,783,554707841],"class_list":["post-6761","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-escapees","category-food","category-friends","category-mexico","category-traveling","tag-chapter-8","tag-mexican-connection","tag-mexico","tag-tecate"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6761","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6761"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6761\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6773,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6761\/revisions\/6773"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6761"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6761"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=6761"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}